# Builds the Great Tusk ("Mighty Boar") fixture: hero 0 slot 61 = slot 60 turned Nemeton and walked through chapter 2
# (the Refuge quests, the spark rite, the first root, the report to Molvina) and the Leuchtwald expedition up to the
# summon circle - the party parked there, Mombert's ReachedAnkerpunkt talk still to come. Chapter stays 3 (4 kills the
# forest). Flag list and order from the game's graphs (see the research notes); every write marked J in them gets a
# second, so the quest graphs write their journal entries.
#
# Run once, then copy Sprint_24_A\Hero_00\Savegame_61 into Sprint_24_B and Sprint_24_C.

launch A
A wait ready=1 timeout=240
A wait saves=separate timeout=1
A load 0 60
A wait world=1 timeout=240

set mombert 8fe6b401-4600-4662-9702-b3cc379f269b
set henik 1d68e5c7-bf2a-4ca5-9366-ca3b27404f08
set gradan aba8ca6e-1f50-4d8d-afb5-083d9c8025d5
set karotte b275519f-3555-4104-890a-c6b1c3726e1a

# ---- The Nemeton join (played out in faction_nemeton.coop), by its result flags. ----
A setgvar QuestVars_StolenWeapons PlayerCanJoinNemeton 1
A setgvar QuestVars_StolenWeapons QuestState 3
sleep 1
A setgvar QuestVars_OneFaction CanJoinMoorlager 1
A setgvar EVars_Player CanAccessNemeton 1
A setgvar EVars_Molvina CanJoin 1
A setgvar EVars_Molvina HasIntroduced 1
A setgvar QuestVars_OneFaction HTT_Molvina 1
A setgvar QuestVars_OneFaction JoinedMoorlager 1
sleep 1
A setgvar EVars_Molvina HTT_PlayerInitial 1
A setgvar WorldVars CurrentChapter 2
A give Armor_Chest_Nemeton_Heavy 1
sleep 2

# --- A. Angus after the join (DT_PreApo_Intent_1_NPC_Angus) --- OPT but real play always does it
A setgvar EVars_Angus_Intent TalkingToPlayerBlackboard 0
A setgvar EVars_Angus HTT_AngusAfterJoined 1
A setgvar EVars_Angus DefaultRoutineDisabled 0

# --- B. TheWay info (Tavern/Tristan) --- OPT, all need GotAnOwnFunken==0 to journal
A setgvar QuestVars_TheWayToTheLeuchtwald HTT_Tristan 1
sleep 1

# --- C. Reaching the Refuge: SaveSweetCay (no QuestGraph, no journal) ---
A setgvar QuestVars_SaveSweetCay EncounteredCay 1
A setgvar QuestVars_SaveSweetCay SavedCay 1
A setgvar EVars_Piglet_Cay ShoutForHelp 0
A setgvar EVars_Birka IsKnown 1
A setgvar EVars_Birka HasIntroduced 1
A setgvar EVars_Birka_Intent TalkToPlayerInitial 0
A setgvar QuestVars_SaveSweetCay HTT_BirkaAboutCay 1
A setgvar QuestVars_SaveSweetCay CayWillGoBackWithBirka 1
A setgvar QuestVars_SaveSweetCay GoIntoCamp 1
A setgvar QuestVars_SaveSweetCay BirkaArrived 1

# --- D. Diemo intro -> TrustTest starts ---
A setgvar EVars_Diemo IsKnown 1
A setgvar EVars_Diemo HasIntroduced 1
A setgvar EVars_Diemo IgnoresPlayer 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest HTT_Diemo 1
sleep 1

# --- E. Roarke intro + YouDoNotFitHere ---
A setgvar EVars_Roarke IsKnown 1
A setgvar EVars_Roarke_Intent OpeningDialogue 0
A setgvar EVars_Roarke HasIntroduced 1
A setgvar EVars_Diemo ArrivedAtDefaultSpotAfterIntro 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TheWayToTheLeuchtwald HTT_InformationAboutFlux 1
sleep 1
A setgvar QuestVars_YouDoNotFitHere HTT_RoarkeAboutMonster 1
sleep 1
A setgvar EVars_Roarke MentionedDarkFlames 1
A setgvar EVars_Tristan MentionedDarkFlames 1
A setgvar EVars_Leru PlayerEnteredLeuchtwald 1
A setgvar QuestVars_YouDoNotFitHere KilledMonster 1
sleep 1
A setgvar QuestVars_YouDoNotFitHere HTT_RoarkeAboutKilledMonster 1
sleep 1

# --- F. FreedomForThePiglets (Taron) --- never write FedPiglets: the graph increments it
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets TalkedToTaronOnce 1
A setgvar EVars_Taron IsKnown 1
A setgvar EVars_Taron HasIntroduced 1
A setgvar EVars_Taron TaronKnowsPlayerName 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets HTT_TaronAboutPiglets 1
sleep 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets HTT_RoarkeAndGotFood 1
sleep 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets NoticedFourthPiglet 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets FedPiglet01 1
sleep 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets Piglet01RunToTaron 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets FedPiglet02 1
sleep 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets Piglet02RunToTaron 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets FedPiglet03 1
sleep 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets Piglet03RunToTaron 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets PigletPetted 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets HTT_TaronAboutFedPiglets 1
sleep 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets TalkedToTaronAboutFourthPiglet 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets ToldTaronAboutRoarkeInformation 1
sleep 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets FedLastPiglet 1
sleep 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets Piglet04RunToTaron 1
A setgvar EVars_Taron DefaultRoutineDisabled 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets TalkedAboutLastPiglet 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets EveryoneMoveToExit 1
sleep 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets TaronArrived 1
A setgvar EVars_Taron ShowNames 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets ThreePigletsRunOff 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets FourthPigletRunOff 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets HTT_TaronAndReleasedPiglets 1
sleep 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets TaronGoBack 1
A setgvar QuestVars_FreedomForThePiglets FinishedQuest 1

# --- G. Birka + Cay (TrustTest Entry_02C) ---
A setgvar EVars_Piglet_Cay PortToBirka 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest StartedPlayingWithCayAndBirka 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest PlayingCatch 1
A setgvar EVars_Piglet_Cay PlayingCatch 0
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest CaughtCay 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest PlayedWithCay 1
A setgvar EVars_Birka HTA_CaysBackstory 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest HTT_Birka 1
sleep 1
A setgvar EVars_Diemo IgnoresPlayer 0

# --- H. Diemo virtues, Bertine, Roarke hint ---
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest HTT_DiemoAboutValues 1
sleep 1
A setgvar EVars_Bertine IsKnown 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest HTT_Bertine 1
sleep 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest HTT_RoarkeAboutBertine 1
sleep 1
A setgvar EVars_Bertine_Intent WanderwesenFought 0
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest HTT_BertineAboutRevenge 1
sleep 1
A setgvar EVars_Bertine HasIntroduced 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest BertineHasBeenConvinced 1

# --- I. Bertine chase + Wanderwesen (spider) ---
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest M_StartTensionMusic 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest ArrivedAtFocus 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest BertineGoAndFocusEindringling 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest ArrivedAtEindringling 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest M_StartMainCombatMusic 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest FollowWanderwesenAfterFight 1
A setgvar Fight_Wanderwesen FoughtBackSpot_01 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest M_StopCombatMusic 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest DroveAwayWanderwesen 1
sleep 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest BertineGoBackToVeil 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest BertineArrivedAtVeilWayBack 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest BertineGoBackToMagieCamp 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest BertineArrivedAtMagiecamp 1
A setgvar EVars_Bertine DefaultRoutineDisabled 0

# --- J. Ritual readiness + Rite of Passage (spark) ---
A setgvar EVars_Diemo HTT_DiemoKilledGestalt 1
A setgvar EVars_Diemo DefaultRoutineDisabled 1
A setgvar EVars_Taron DefaultRoutineDisabled 1
A setgvar EVars_Roarke DefaultRoutineDisabled 1
A setgvar EVars_Piglet_Cay DefaultRoutineDisabled 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest HTT_DiemoAboutWanderwesenGone 1
sleep 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest EveryoneMoveToBestimmung 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest BirkaArrivedBackAtDefault 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest DiemoArrivedAtBestimmung 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest BirkaArrivedAtBestimmung 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest CayArrivedAtBestimmung 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest RoarkeArrivedAtBestimmung 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest TaronArrivedAtBestimmung 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest M_Funken_StartInit 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest M_Funken_Phase2 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest M_Funken_Phase3 1
A setgvar EVars_Birka ReceivedWisp 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest M_Funken_Phase4 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest M_Funken_Phase5 1
A setgvar EVars_Diemo AskedWhyChosen 1
A setgvar EVars_Diemo AskedIfNächster 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest BestimmungCompleted 1
sleep 1
A give Cons_Familiar_FireFly 1
A setgvar QuestVars_JourneyToTheRoots PortNPCsToRoots 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest M_Funken_Finish 1

# --- K. Leaving the ceremony -> Diemo: Blackflame + first root (spark becomes "own") ---
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest EveryoneBackToStandardSpot 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest RoarkeArrivedBackAtDefault 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest TaronArrivedBackAtDefault 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest CayArrivedBackAtDefault 1
A setgvar EVars_Roarke DefaultRoutineDisabled 0
A setgvar EVars_Taron DefaultRoutineDisabled 0
A setgvar EVars_Piglet_Cay DefaultRoutineDisabled 0
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest DiemoArrivedBackAtDefault 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TrustTest DiemoExplainedDarkFlames 1
A setgvar QuestVars_JourneyToTheRoots DiemoArrivedAtVeil 1
A setgvar QuestVars_JourneyToTheRoots DiemoGoToVeil 1
A setgvar QuestVars_JourneyToTheRoots DiemoArrivedAtMother 1
A setgvar QuestVars_JourneyToTheRoots DiemoGoToMother 1
A setgvar QuestVars_JourneyToTheRoots CanInteractWithRoot 1
A setgvar QuestVars_JourneyToTheRoots VisitedFirstRoot 1
A setgvar QuestVars_TheWayToTheLeuchtwald GotAnOwnFunken 1
sleep 1
A setgvar QuestVars_JourneyToTheRoots HTT_Diemo 1
sleep 1
A setgvar QuestVars_JourneyToTheRoots DiemoArrivedAtDefaultSpot 1
A setgvar QuestVars_JourneyToTheRoots DiemoGoBackDefaultSpot 1
A setgvar EVars_Diemo DefaultRoutineDisabled 0

# --- L. Molvina: start the expedition (DT_Quest_StartExpedition_NPC_Molvina) ---
A setgvar QuestVars_TheWayToTheLeuchtwald ReportedBack 1
sleep 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton StartPreExpeditionIdleRoutines 1
A setgvar EVars_Mombert DefaultRoutineDisabled 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton MombertGoToExpedition 1
A setgvar EVars_Molvina HTA_WhatHappensWhenBoarFound 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton OnExpedition 1
sleep 1
A setgvar WorldVars CurrentChapter 3
A setgvar EVars_Angus DefaultRoutineDisabled 1
A setgvar EVars_Henik DefaultRoutineDisabled 1
A setgvar EVars_Bonny DefaultRoutineDisabled 1
A setgvar EVars_Karotte DefaultRoutineDisabled 1
A setgvar EVars_Gradan DefaultRoutineDisabled 1
A setgvar EVars_Henik_IsBusy IsBusy 0
A setgvar EVars_Mombert IsCrimeDisabled 1
A setgvar EVars_Henik IsCrimeDisabled 1
A setgvar EVars_Karotte IsCrimeDisabled 1
A setgvar EVars_Gradan IsCrimeDisabled 1
A setgvar EVars_Mombert HasIntroduced 1
A setgvar EVars_Henik HasIntroduced 1
A setgvar EVars_Gradan HasIntroduced 1
A setgvar EVars_Karotte HasIntroduced 1
A setgvar EVars_Henik_Intent RunBackToNemeton_OnFinishTalk 0
A setgvar EVars_Henik_Intent MeetPlayerFirstTimeMoorlager 0
A setgvar EVars_Karotte_Intent TalkToPlayerAfterFightingMobs 0
A setgvar EVars_Gradan_Intent TalkAboutKarotteWeapon 0
A setgvar EVars_Asmus_Intent TalkToAiko 0
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton MombertArrivedAtExpeditionStart 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton TalkedToHenikAndBonny 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton TalkedToMombertAndAngus 1

# --- M. Mombert "I'm ready for the expedition." (DT_Quest_IntroExpedition_NPC_Mombert) ---
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton RuinEntranceLeuchtwald_Reached 1
A setgvar EVars_Mombert M_Start_Intro_Expedition_01 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton StartExpedition 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton StopPreExpeditionIdleRoutines 1
A setgvar EVars_Angus DefaultRoutineDisabled 0
A setgvar EVars_Bonny DefaultRoutineDisabled 0
A setgvar EVars_Mombert M_EndIntro_Expedition 1

# --- N. Walk segments (Reached before Start) ---
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton OpenDoorToLeuchtwald 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton RegroupAfterFight_Reached 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton RegroupAfterFight_Start 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton IsBearDead 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton ActivateBear 1
# ActivateBear spawns the LightBear a real save has dead. Its death re-fires BoarEncounter_Start 0 and
# TalkAfterBearFight 1; both are written back below (BoarEncounter_Start by the walk segments, the intent at the end).
sleep 2
A tpnear 2de9311d-c95e-4fb5-8d49-96341b397a34 250 0
A expect near 2de9311d-c95e-4fb5-8d49-96341b397a34 600 contains loaded timeout=20
A kill 2de9311d-c95e-4fb5-8d49-96341b397a34
sleep 2
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton GradanIsInjured 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton BoarEncounter_Reached 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton BoarEncounter_Start 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton ChoseNotToKillBoar 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton ActivateBoar 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton LookAtMagielager_Reached 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton LookAtMagielager_Start 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton RestAtCamp_Reached 1
sleep 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton RestAtCamp_Start 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton ActivateCamp 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton InitialTalkAtCampfire 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton EnteredLoreDialogue 1
A setgvar EVars_Warning_Duskwood KnowWillCatchBoar 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton MombertWarnedPlayerBeforeSleeping 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton ActivateSleepingPlace 1
A setgvar EVars_Henik_Intent LeavePlayerPartyExpeditionNemeton 0
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton PlayerSlept 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton RemoveObstacle_Reached 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton RemoveObstacle_Start 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton Bossfight_Start 1

# --- O. Target (pick one) ---
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton Bossfight_Reached 1
sleep 1
A setgvar EVars_Mombert_Intent Bossfight_OnFinishTalk 1
A setgvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton PlayerNeedTime 1
# The bear's death set this intent again.
A setgvar EVars_Mombert_Intent TalkAfterBearFight 0
A expect gvar WorldVars CurrentChapter == 3 timeout=5
A expect gvar QuestVars_ExpeditionNemeton QuestState == 2 timeout=5

A save 61
sleep 8
A load 0 61
sleep 10
A wait world=1 timeout=240

# The ports the walk would have made, then the checks: every expedition NPC parked at the circle.
A port $mombert
A port $henik
A port $gradan
A port $karotte
sleep 3
A tp -7916,-821
sleep 5
A expect ai $mombert contains Ankerpunkt_WaitForPlayer timeout=15
A expect ai $henik contains Ankerpunkt_WaitForPlayer timeout=15
A expect ai $gradan contains Ankerpunkt_WaitForPlayer timeout=15
A expect ai $karotte contains Ankerpunkt_WaitForPlayer timeout=15
A expect near $mombert 300 contains "1 dist" timeout=15
A expect gvar WorldVars Leuchtwald_Destroyed == 0 timeout=1

A save 61
sleep 8
